# Called inside each locale of generate-player-guide.ps1; uses its localized page helpers.
Guide-Entry 'resource_costs' '专注与魔力怎么算' 'Understanding Focus and Mana' 'modularmagic:mana_container_basic' 'editor' 2 @(
    (Guide-Text '先看这里' 'Read This First' '手持法杖时，屏幕会显示随身容器的可用魔力与自己的专注。施法前先看成型核心的基础消耗，再确认法杖的消耗倍率。$(br2)以太与魔力的大数值用 K（千）、M（百万）、B（十亿）表示。本书记录常见规律，以你手中核心的读数为准；创造模式不消耗资源。' 'Hold a wand to see available inventory mana and focus. Check the formed core for base costs and the wand for its multipliers.$(br2)Aether and mana amounts use K (thousand), M (million), and B (billion). This guide records common rules; trust the readings on your core. Creative mode spends no resources.')
    (Guide-Text '两种资源' 'Two Resources' '专注是控制法术的余力，属于玩家，可以自行恢复。结构越复杂，通常越费专注。$(br2)魔力储存在物品里，不会自行回满，需要外部充能。伤害、范围、人数和持续效果主要影响魔力。' 'Focus is your ability to control a spell. It belongs to the player and recovers naturally.$(br2)Mana belongs to items and does not regenerate. It needs an external supply. Damage, area, targets and duration mainly affect mana.')
    (Guide-Text '起步费用与复杂度' 'Base Cost and Complexity' '每次施法的专注消耗为：$(br2)F=5+10C+0.625C²$(br2)5 是固定起步费用，C 是整套结构的复杂度。普通实体效果贡献 0.1，空间修饰贡献 0.05。先汇总复杂度，再换算一次费用。伤害数值和实际人数不改变 C。' 'Each cast costs:$(br2)F=5+10*C+0.625*C^2$(br2)5 is the fixed startup cost; C is total structural complexity. An entity effect contributes 0.1 and a modifier 0.05. Combine complexity before converting to focus once. Damage values and actual target counts do not change C.')
    (Guide-Text '简单与复杂法术' 'Simple and Complex Spells' '同样使用自身选区，装入伤害效果：$(br2)1 个：C=0.3，约 8.06 专注。$(br)10 个：C=1.2，17.90 专注。$(br)50 个：C=5.2，73.90 专注。$(br2)复杂结构的额外负担会逐渐增加。单纯提高其中一个节点的伤害，只增加魔力费用。' 'Using the same self selector and damage effects:$(br2)1 effect: C=0.3, about 8.06 focus.$(br)10 effects: C=1.2, 17.90 focus.$(br)50 effects: C=5.2, 73.90 focus.$(br2)More complex structures carry an increasing burden. Raising one damage value only increases mana.')
    (Guide-Text '循环怎么算' 'Loops' '设后续动作的复杂度为 C，最多执行 n 次。普通循环的复杂度为：$(br2)0.2 + L(n)×C$(br2)L(n)=log2(1+n)。例如 C=0.3、n=10，这段循环的复杂度约为 1.238，再与其他结构合并计算最终专注。循环内的魔力仍按每次效果计算。' 'Let C be body complexity and n the maximum repetitions. Loop complexity is:$(br2)0.2 + L(n)*C$(br2)L(n)=log2(1+n). For C=0.3 and n=10, loop complexity is about 1.238; combine it with the rest of the structure before calculating focus. Mana still counts every effect.')
    (Guide-Text '等待与间隔' 'Delays' '等待 t tick 的额外复杂度为 0.15+H(t)，再加后续动作的复杂度。$(br2)H(t)=0.05×log2(1+t/20)。通常 20 tick 为一秒。间隔循环还会计算从第一次到最后一次的等待跨度。专注在启动时计入，不会每过一 tick 再收一次。' 'A delay adds 0.15+H(t) complexity, plus its action.$(br2)H(t)=0.05*log2(1+t/20), with t in ticks. Normally 20 ticks make a second. Repeated delays use the span from first to last repetition, rather than charging focus each tick.')
    (Guide-Text '条件与备用分支' 'Branches' '条件分支的复杂度为：$(br2)0.1+P+max(A,B)+0.25×min(A,B)$(br2)P 是条件复杂度，A、B 是两组动作的复杂度。即使这次只走一支，准备备用动作也有少量负担。魔力只按实际执行的那支消费，预留则按较贵的一支。' 'Branch complexity is:$(br2)0.1+P+max(A,B)+0.25*min(A,B)$(br2)P is condition complexity; A and B are branch complexities. Preparing a fallback adds a small burden. Mana pays for the chosen branch, but reserves for the more expensive one.')
    (Guide-Text '伤害的魔力价格' 'Damage Prices' '普通伤害每目标每次消耗：$(br2)m(d)=500d+12.5d²$(br2)4 点伤害需 2200 魔力，20 点需 15000，100 点需 175000。单次伤害越高，每点伤害越贵。默认价格不随伤害类型改变。专注不随 d 增加。' 'Ordinary damage costs, per target and attempt:$(br2)m(d)=500*d+12.5*d*d$(br2)Damage 4 costs 2200 mana; 20 costs 15000; 100 costs 175000. Stronger single hits cost more per damage point. Damage types share the default price. Focus does not grow with d.')
    (Guide-Text '整数结算' 'Whole Mana Costs' '法术内部会先累加各效果的费用，再乘法杖倍率，最终魔力消耗向上取整。核心上的基础魔力提示也向上取整。$(br2)例如启动费 10，加 10 个各计 0.2 的粒子，合计消耗 12 魔力；只加 1 个粒子时，10.2 向上取为 11。专注仍可带小数。' 'Effect fees accumulate before applying the wand multiplier. Total mana is rounded up to a whole number, as is the base mana shown on cores.$(br2)For example, startup 10 plus ten particles priced at 0.2 costs 12 mana. Startup plus one particle rounds 10.2 up to 11. Focus may still be fractional.')
    (Guide-Text '先预留，再结算' 'Reserve, Then Settle' '开始前，会从背包和副手的容器预留足以完成法术的魔力。不够就不启动，魔力和专注都不扣。$(br2)完全打空时，未用预留默认只返还 50%，其余作为损耗。若已对有效目标尝试执行效果，多余预留仍全额返还。已花掉的启动、投送与查询费不退；已对目标尝试的伤害也不因免疫而退款。施放条件未满足时，准备法术所用的专注和实际查询费仍会消耗。' 'Before starting, reserve enough mana from inventory and offhand containers to complete the spell. Insufficient mana prevents the cast without spending either resource.$(br2)A complete miss returns only 50% of unused reserves by default; the rest is lost. After a valid target attempt, unused reserves return in full. Startup, delivery, queries and damage attempts remain paid, even if a target resists. A failed casting condition still spends preparation focus and actual query fees.')
    (Guide-Text '打空时的损耗' 'Missed Spell Losses' '假设法术结束时还有 1000 魔力未使用，默认返还 500，另 500 损失。已消耗的启动、查询和效果费用不退。$(br2)纯装饰、方块法术及施放条件未满足的尝试默认不收这笔损耗。不同世界散逸的程度或有差别，请留意罐中实际回流的量。返还向下取整，最终消耗仍为整数。' 'If a spell ends with 1000 unused mana, the default refund is 500 and the other 500 is lost. Startup, queries and effect fees already spent are not refunded.$(br2)Cosmetic spells, block spells and failed casting conditions are exempt by default. Different worlds may lose different amounts; watch what actually returns to your jars. Refunds round down to keep consumption whole.')
    (Guide-Text '专注不足时' 'When Focus Runs Low' '魔力足够时，这次能够明确结束的法术仍能开始，专注可以降到负数。它已经启动的延迟与弹体也会继续完成。$(br2)随后不能启动新法术，直到专注完全恢复。持续引导会在下一次重复施放前停止；已经施放的部分不被撤销。' 'With enough mana, a bounded spell may overdraw focus below zero and finish its delayed effects and projectiles.$(br2)No new spells can start until focus fully recovers. Channeling stops before its next pulse; effects already started are not undone.')
    (Guide-Text '打空不退专注' 'Focus Is Never Refunded' '专注在法术启动时按结构一次扣除，与命中了多少目标无关。打空、魔力返还或取消后续效果，都不会把这笔专注退回来。$(br2)返还比例只影响物品中的魔力。即使剩下的魔力全部回到了容器，专注仍按正常速度恢复；透支后仍需等到回满才能继续施法。' 'Structural focus is paid once when the spell starts, regardless of target count. Missing, refunding mana or cancelling later effects never returns that focus.$(br2)The refund ratio affects item mana only. Even at a 100% mana refund, focus must recover normally, and overdraw still locks casting until it is full.')
    (Guide-Text '负债与恢复条' 'Debt and Recovery' '专注透支后，红条显示尚未偿还的负债；负债归零后，恢复条继续向上填充，直到回满才解除熔断。默认每秒恢复 10 点，从 0 回到上限 100 需要约 10 秒；负债另算。$(br2)例如专注上限为 100 时，地刺阵约消耗 136.98，会降到 -36.98；正常游戏速度下，回满约需 13.7 秒。光影太密时，你可能看不清每一道微光；法术的作用与耗费仍照常。' 'After overdraw, the red bar shows remaining focus debt. Once it reaches zero, the recovery bar fills until focus is full and lockout ends. Recovery defaults to 10 per second: zero to maximum 100 takes about 10 seconds, with extra time for debt.$(br2)With maximum 100, Earth Spike Field costs about 136.98 and leaves -36.98. Full recovery takes about 13.7 seconds at normal tick speed. Not every glimmer remains visible in a dense burst, but the spell''s effects and costs remain the same.')
    (Guide-Text '外观不该成为负担' 'Keep Your Effects' '每个粒子消耗 0.2 魔力，每次声音 1，二者不增加结构复杂度。纯装饰控制结构的复杂度只计 2%；纯装饰法术启动魔力为 10。$(br2)每次独立施法仍需支付固定的 5 点专注，在已有法术中添加特效则没有这笔额外起步费用。$(br2)把法术装点得好看一些，不必因此付出昂贵的代价。' 'A particle costs 0.2 mana and a sound 1; both add zero complexity. Purely decorative controls use 2% of normal complexity; decorative startup costs 10 mana.$(br2)Every separate cast still pays the fixed 5 focus. Adding effects to an existing spell does not add another startup cost.$(br2)A beautiful spell need not be an expensive one.')
    (Guide-Text '效果页里的符号' 'Symbols in Effect Entries' 'd：请求伤害；v：速度；r：传送距离；t：持续 tick；a：效果的内部等级，0 表示 I 级；k：公式中的价格系数，默认 1。$(br2)持续状态初始价为 20×t×(a+1)²×k。瞬间效果不用时长打折，改为 1000×(a+1)²×k。实际耗费以核心上的读数为准。' 'd: requested damage; v: speed; r: teleport distance; t: ticks; a: amplifier, where zero means level I; k: price factor, default 1.$(br2)Timed effects start at 20*t*(a+1)^2*k. Instant effects use 1000*(a+1)^2*k. Trust the actual readings on your core.')
    (Guide-Text '法杖与创造模式' 'Wands and Creative Mode' '魔力和专注分别乘以法杖对应的倍率。初学者法杖默认都是 1，创造法杖都是 0。$(br2)创造模式下，任何法杖都不扣魔力或专注，也不会被专注熔断拦住。生存模式携带创造魔力容器时，魔力无限，但普通法杖仍会消耗专注。' 'Mana and focus each use the corresponding wand multiplier: 1 for the beginner wand and 0 for the creative wand.$(br2)In creative mode, all wands cast without resource costs or focus lockout. An infinite mana container in survival supplies unlimited mana, but an ordinary wand still spends focus.')
    (Guide-Text '选区与施法限制' 'Selections and Limits' '一次选区默认最多影响 8 个目标，按离选区起点的距离从近到远选取。预留魔力时会为这 8 个名额准备费用；通常只支付实际目标；完全打空时另计未用预留的损耗。$(br2)法术的次数、范围、寿命和并发数量也有上限。无法确定有限费用的表达式，或超过上限的法术，不能启动。请缩小范围或次数。' 'Each selection affects at most 8 targets by default, nearest to its origin first. Reserves cover all 8 slots; settlement normally pays only for actual targets; a complete miss also loses part of the unused reserve.$(br2)Repetitions, range, lifetime and simultaneous casts also have limits. Unbounded costs or excessive settings prevent casting. Reduce the range or repetitions.')
    (Guide-Text '核心上的基础消耗' 'Base Costs on Cores' '核心的物品说明会按保存的数值计算基础魔力与专注。局部变量、循环索引、次数、范围和状态等级都会代入。$(br2)基础报价按单目标和初学者倍率 1 计算。实际人数、传送距离或尚未产生的随机值等额外部分，不包含在固定基础值中。' 'Core tooltips calculate base mana and focus from saved values, including local variables, loop indices, repetition counts, areas and effect levels.$(br2)Base prices assume one target and multipliers of 1. Additional targets, travel distance and future random values are not part of the fixed base.')
)
